{"3306920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Fear", "steam_appid": 3306920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/cd9d1c4d506e60b2c076a88d1492c187.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/cd9d1c4d506e60b2c076a88d1492c187.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/cd9d1c4d506e60b2c076a88d1492c187.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the dawn of mankind, mysterious phenomena beyond human comprehension have occurred. Your studies suggest that everything is part of one big picture. The solution is near; the next expedition will be the crucial one. You turn your gaze to the stars: what lies hidden in the unfathomable depths of the cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/ac88e7b95bd838d29cd9111ec7564724.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/ac88e7b95bd838d29cd9111ec7564724.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/ac88e7b95bd838d29cd9111ec7564724.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night falls as the horn’s haunting call echoes through the woods. The Great Ceremony is about to begin, and nothing will ever be the same again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Fear</strong> is a disturbing Lovecraftian first-person horror adventure from the author of <i>The Land of Pain</i> and <i>The Alien Cube</i>. Investigate signs of an ancient presence and uncover a forgotten chapter of humanity’s past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive deadly encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable dangers and stay alive as you navigate hostile environments where every step may lead to a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b8f45cc38d5a7d16ef3ea56db7f0d1ad.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b8f45cc38d5a7d16ef3ea56db7f0d1ad.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b8f45cc38d5a7d16ef3ea56db7f0d1ad.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate and solve puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, search for clues and solve puzzles to progress deeper into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compelling story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story filled with mystery and terror, drawn from the darkest corners of Lovecraft’s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/170035c8a35d8d1411d12aca92565209.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/170035c8a35d8d1411d12aca92565209.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/170035c8a35d8d1411d12aca92565209.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience highly detailed environments with cutting‑edge graphics powered by photogrammetry and Unreal Engine 5. Dynamic lights, shadows and volumetric fog create a visceral, oppressive atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive sounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting soundscape, where even the slightest noise suggests something lurking in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new chapter in the series</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the universe of <i>The Land of Pain</i> and <i>The Alien Cube</i> in this haunting new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b89c5669facdfb6bcb93bd8cde01af69.avif?t=1787089389\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras_big/b89c5669facdfb6bcb93bd8cde01af69.webp?t=1787089389 width=1560 height=951 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the dawn of mankind, mysterious phenomena beyond human comprehension have occurred. Your studies suggest that everything is part of one big picture. The solution is near; the next expedition will be the crucial one. You turn your gaze to the stars: what lies hidden in the unfathomable depths of the cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/ac88e7b95bd838d29cd9111ec7564724.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/ac88e7b95bd838d29cd9111ec7564724.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/ac88e7b95bd838d29cd9111ec7564724.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night falls as the horn’s haunting call echoes through the woods. The Great Ceremony is about to begin, and nothing will ever be the same again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Fear</strong> is a disturbing Lovecraftian first-person horror adventure from the author of <i>The Land of Pain</i> and <i>The Alien Cube</i>. Investigate signs of an ancient presence and uncover a forgotten chapter of humanity’s past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive deadly encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable dangers and stay alive as you navigate hostile environments where every step may lead to a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b8f45cc38d5a7d16ef3ea56db7f0d1ad.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b8f45cc38d5a7d16ef3ea56db7f0d1ad.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b8f45cc38d5a7d16ef3ea56db7f0d1ad.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate and solve puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, search for clues and solve puzzles to progress deeper into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compelling story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story filled with mystery and terror, drawn from the darkest corners of Lovecraft’s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/170035c8a35d8d1411d12aca92565209.poster.avif?t=1787089389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/170035c8a35d8d1411d12aca92565209.webm?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/170035c8a35d8d1411d12aca92565209.mp4?t=1787089389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience highly detailed environments with cutting‑edge graphics powered by photogrammetry and Unreal Engine 5. Dynamic lights, shadows and volumetric fog create a visceral, oppressive atmosphere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive sounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting soundscape, where even the slightest noise suggests something lurking in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A new chapter in the series</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the universe of <i>The Land of Pain</i> and <i>The Alien Cube</i> in this haunting new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras/b89c5669facdfb6bcb93bd8cde01af69.avif?t=1787089389\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/extras_big/b89c5669facdfb6bcb93bd8cde01af69.webp?t=1787089389 width=1560 height=951 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You’ve discovered evidence of a cosmic presence influencing humanity since its origins. Now something born in the depths of the cosmos is calling again. Investigate, uncover forbidden knowledge and survive a disturbing first person Lovecraftian horror adventure.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/header.jpg?t=1787089389", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/f01cd78c942831b884eeae54c3a944e99ff151a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787089389", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306920/f01cd78c942831b884eeae54c3a944e99ff151a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787089389", "website": "https://www.guzzoproductions.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 7700k / AMD 1700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 Super / AMD RX 5500xt 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 36 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is highly recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 11600k / AMD 5600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</s